### Place an order
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"sku": "MOUSE-1", "quantity": 2},
    {"sku": "HDMI-2M", "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### Check its status (PENDING right after the POST, then CONFIRMED)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### More monitors than in stock (5) -> REJECTED a moment later
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"sku": "MON-27", "quantity": 50}
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id); %}

### Check the rejected order
GET http://localhost:8081/api/orders/{{orderId}}

### Unknown and inactive products -> 422 with unknownSkus
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"sku": "NOPE", "quantity": 1},
    {"sku": "CAM-720", "quantity": 1}
  ]
}

### Invalid request -> 400
POST http://localhost:8081/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {"sku": "MOUSE-1", "quantity": 0}
  ]
}

### Circuit breaker state for the price lookup (stop product-service to see it open)
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakers

### Recent retries and circuit breaker transitions
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/retryevents

###
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/circuitbreakerevents
